# Only the Trung Thu card is published for now. Everything else is left out of the Cloudflare upload, so
# every other route answers 404. To publish another card again, add a line like `!/t/<id>/` under `/t/*`
# (and `!/index.html` etc. for the landing page, with its line removed from _redirects).
/*
!/t/
/t/*
!/t/trung-thu-2026/
!/_redirects
